<LegalPageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Landscape Estimate Pro"
  description="How Landscape Estimate Pro handles your data. Business and estimate data stays on your device — nothing is uploaded to a server."
  h1="Privacy Policy"
  updated="January 2026"
>
  <h2>Local-first by design</h2>
  <p>
    Landscape Estimate Pro's calculators, templates, and Pro application run entirely in your browser. The
    materials, labor rates, equipment, assemblies, projects, and estimates you enter are stored in your browser's
    local storage, on your own device. We do not operate a database that stores your business or project data, and
    it is never transmitted to our servers.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do collect</h2>
  <p>
    We use standard, privacy-respecting web analytics (page views and basic navigation events) to understand which
    pages and tools are useful, and to process payment for Pro through our payment provider. Payment processing is
    handled entirely by that provider — we do not receive or store your card details.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This site may use essential cookies for basic site function and analytics cookies to understand aggregate
    traffic. No advertising cookies are used to build a profile of you across other sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Your data, your control</h2>
  <p>
    Because your workspace lives in your browser, clearing your browser's site data for this domain will remove it.
    Pro includes a JSON export/import feature specifically so you can back up your workspace or move it to a new
    device or browser before that happens.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to the contact information provided at checkout.</p>
</LegalPageLayout>
